            { id: 8, difficulty: 'hard', question: abscissa('min', '\\frac{x^2}{x-2}'), solution: say('$f\'(x)=\\frac{x^2-4x}{(x-2)^2}$ zero da 0 eta 4 puntuetan; $x=4$ puntuan $-$ zeinutik $+$ zeinura pasatzen da: minimoa $x=4$ puntuan.', '$f\'(x)=\\frac{x^2-4x}{(x-2)^2}$ se anula en 0 y en 4; en $x=4$ pasa de $-$ a $+$: mínimo en $x=4$.', 'تنعدم $f\'(x)=\\frac{x^2-4x}{(x-2)^2}$ عند 0 و4؛ وعند $x=4$ تنتقل من $-$ إلى $+$: قيمة صغرى عند $x=4$.', '$f\'(x)=\\frac{x^2-4x}{(x-2)^2}$ is 0 at 0 and at 4; at $x=4$ it goes from $-$ to $+$: a minimum at $x=4$.'), answer: { expected: n(4) } },
            { id: 9, difficulty: 'hard', question: sketch('\\frac{x}{(x-1)^2}'), solution: say('Asintota bertikala $x=1$ (bi aldeetatik $f\\to+\\infty$) eta horizontala $y=0$. $f\'(x)=\\frac{-x-1}{(x-1)^3}=0\\ \\to\\ x=-1$: minimoa $\\left(-1,\\,-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$ puntuan. $(0,\\,0)$ puntuan ebakitzen du.', 'Asíntota vertical $x=1$ (por los dos lados $f\\to+\\infty$) y horizontal $y=0$. $f\'(x)=\\frac{-x-1}{(x-1)^3}=0\\ \\to\\ x=-1$: mínimo en $\\left(-1,\\,-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$. Corta en $(0,\\,0)$.', 'مقارب رأسي $x=1$ (من الجهتين $f\\to+\\infty$) وأفقي $y=0$. $f\'(x)=\\frac{-x-1}{(x-1)^3}=0\\ \\to\\ x=-1$: قيمة صغرى عند $\\left(-1,\\,-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$. تقطع عند $(0,\\,0)$.', 'Vertical asymptote $x=1$ ($f\\to+\\infty$ on both sides) and horizontal $y=0$. $f\'(x)=\\frac{-x-1}{(x-1)^3}=0\\ \\to\\ x=-1$: a minimum at $\\left(-1,\\,-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$. It cuts at $(0,\\,0)$.') },
            { id: 10, difficulty: 'hard', question: oblique('\\frac{2x^2+3x}{x-1}', 'm+n'), solution: same('$\\begin{gathered}2x^2+3x=(x-1)(2x+5)+5\\\\ y=2x+5\\ \\to\\ m+n=2+5=7\\end{gathered}$'), answer: { expected: n(7) } }
